                    1159.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- Scheduled: In the scheduled control mode, the SECC and the EVCC negotiate a power profile based on the information exchanged in the ScheduleList element. In this control mode, the EVCC is responsible for computing an EVPowerProfile compliant with the user's mobility needs.",
            "block_bbox": [
                103,
                1164,
                1049,
                1244
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 15,
            "group_id": 15,
